  "about": "The one thing a door does to a standing that is not a message. A standing widens and narrows by the house changing its own mind, and the law is emphatic that nobody is told — so there is nothing on the wire to pin and the obligation lives entirely in what two describes either side of the change say. No corpus vector could hold it: both describes are well-formed answers, and what makes the pair mean something is that one act with no bytes happened between them.",
